# Screenshot of the Sweeps and Monte Carlo sections of the Simulation tab on
# examples/ihp-inv: a vdd sweep, 20 Monte Carlo runs, the run plan next to Run. Needs
# PDK_ROOT. Writes sim-sweeps.png.
# Run: scripts/gen-doc-screenshots.sh docs/screenshots/sweeps.script
window 1400 1750
panel Library Manager
wait 0.3
open cells tb_inv testbench
sim expect_target cells/tb_inv/testbench
sim add_sweep vdd 1.08,1.2,1.32
sim add_sweep cl 10f,20f,30f
sim mc on
sim set_mc runs 20
sim set_mc seed 1
sim expect_plan 180
wait 0.5
screenshot @SHOTS@/sim-sweeps.png
quit
